      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In the middle of the dining room, Max charms the Chinese tour group by demonstrating how to crush and peel garlic cloves by shaking them vigorously between two bowls. When Chef Barinov suddenly returns and starts yelling at Max, the interpreter calmly turns his outburst into polite commentary.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Но сначала я покажу вам.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "И ладошкой начинаем давить.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Ножиком отрезаем попки чеснока.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Берем миску.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
